d Galvin attribution unverified"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-reduced-product-specialization-preservation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-reduced-product-specialization-preservation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-reduced-product-specialization-preservation — Local Reduced-Product Preservation Criterion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"528afa8a8db7f8be\" href=\"?note=528afa8a8db7f8be\" title=\"17-df-sentence-truth\">17-df-sentence-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"50a46bce013b2772\" href=\"?note=50a46bce013b2772\" title=\"17-df-filter\">17-df-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bdee1a47445fb8d1\" href=\"?note=bdee1a47445fb8d1\" title=\"17-df-reduced-product-specialization\">17-df-reduced-product-specialization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1e5b78bfb3887990\" href=\"?note=1e5b78bfb3887990\" title=\"17-df-horn-formula\">17-df-horn-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-6.3.5"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> (sentences, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> (structures and truth, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"528afa8a8db7f8be\" href=\"?note=528afa8a8db7f8be\" title=\"17-df-sentence-truth\">17-df-sentence-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)\">\\(\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)\\)</span> (proper-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"50a46bce013b2772\" href=\"?note=50a46bce013b2772\" title=\"17-df-filter\">17-df-filter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GeneralizedProduct}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{GeneralizedProduct}_L\\)</span> (generalized-product predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"bdee1a47445fb8d1\" href=\"?note=bdee1a47445fb8d1\" title=\"17-df-reduced-product-specialization\">17-df-reduced-product-specialization</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HornSent}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{HornSent}_L\\)</span> (Horn sentences, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"1e5b78bfb3887990\" href=\"?note=1e5b78bfb3887990\" title=\"17-df-horn-formula\">17-df-horn-formula</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\to\n\\Biggl[\n&amp;\\forall I\\,\\forall D\\,\\forall(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\\,\\forall\\mathfrak B\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L))\n\\land\n\\operatorname{GeneralizedProduct}_L\n\\bigl((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},D,\\mathfrak B\\bigr)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\models\\sigma)\n\\to\n\\mathfrak B\\models\\sigma\n\\Bigr)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\in\\operatorname{HornSent}_L\\;\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n(\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models\\tau)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\to\n\\Biggl[\n&amp;\\forall I\\,\\forall D\\,\\forall(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\\,\\forall\\mathfrak B\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L))\n\\land\n\\operatorname{GeneralizedProduct}_L\n\\bigl((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},D,\\mathfrak B\\bigr)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\models\\sigma)\n\\to\n\\mathfrak B\\models\\sigma\n\\Bigr)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\in\\operatorname{HornSent}_L\\;\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n(\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models\\tau)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>In <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"bdee1a47445fb8d1\" href=\"?note=bdee1a47445fb8d1\" title=\"17-df-reduced-product-specialization\">17-df-reduced-product-specialization</a>, generalized products are reduced products by filters, so the correct syntactic counterpart is Horn form rather than an undefined positive-sentence class.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本次滤子接口修订：此处显式使用真滤子，与既有约化积构造的定义域一致；原书允许不真滤子的广义定义未在本节点采用。原有来源与证明核验限制继续有效。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence-truth","status":"resolved","id":"528afa8a8db7f8be","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"50a46bce013b2772","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-reduced-product-specialization","status":"resolved","id":"bdee1a47445fb8d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-reduced-product-specialization]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-horn-formula","status":"resolved","id":"1e5b78bfb3887990","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-horn-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ (sentences, see [[17-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ and $\\models$ (structures and truth, see [[17-df-structure]] and [[17-df-sentence-truth]])","emb