\n\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\to\n\\Biggl[\n&\\forall I\\,\\forall D\\,\\forall(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\\,\\forall\\mathfrak B\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)\n\\\\\n&\\quad{}\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L))\n\\land\n\\operatorname{GeneralizedProduct}_L\n\\bigl((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},D,\\mathfrak B\\bigr)\n\\\\\n&\\quad{}\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\models\\sigma)\n\\to\n\\mathfrak B\\models\\sigma\n\\Bigr)\n\\\\\n&\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\in\\operatorname{HornSent}_L\\;\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n(\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models\\tau)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2837,"backlinks":[{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-211","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-thm-aleph-one-categoricity-consequences]]\n[[17-thm-atomic-model-existence]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability-satisfaction-form]]\n[[17-thm-chain-sentence-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-chain-theory-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-compactness]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-equivalents]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-henkin-form]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-ultraproduct-form]]\n[[17-thm-completeness-characterization]]\n[[17-thm-countable-back-and-forth]]\n[[17-thm-countable-omitting-types]]\n[[17-thm-craig-interpolation]]\n[[17-thm-craig-interpolation-common-language]]\n[[17-thm-dense-linear-order-qe]]\n[[17-thm-diagram-embedding]]\n[[17-thm-downward-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-thm-ehrenfeucht-mostowski]]\n[[17-thm-elementary-amalgamation]]\n[[17-thm-elementary-chain-union]]\n[[17-thm-elementary-diagram-embedding]]\n[[17-thm-erdos-rado]]\n[[17-thm-existential-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-extended-omitting-types]]\n[[17-thm-finite-ramsey]]\n[[17-thm-fraisse-limit]]\n[[17-thm-horn-axiomatization]]\n[[17-thm-horn-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-horn-sentence-characterization]]\n[[17-thm-horn-sentence-reduced-products]]\n[[17-thm-horn-theory-reduced-products]]\n[[17-th